        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: அறிகுறி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அறிகுறி — aṟikuṟi — \"a symptom; a sign\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காய்ச்சல் இந்த நோயின் முதல் அறிகுறி. kāyccal inta nōyiṉ mutal aṟikuṟi. Fever is the first symptom of this illness."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: அறிகுறிகள், aṟikuṟikaḷ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அறி \"to know\" + குறி \"a mark\": a mark that lets you know."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அறிகுறி (aṟikuṟi) is a native compound of அறி aṟi, \"to know\" (DEDR 314), and குறி kuṟi, \"a mark, a sign\" (DEDR 1847)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
